{"game": "sniper-elite-resistance", "language": "english", "appid": 2169200, "month": "2025-04", "window": 1, "start_date": 1743465600, "end_date": 1744070399, "month_true_total": 127, "quota": 10, "returned": 10, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 09:03:36 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "192240128", "author": {"steamid": "76561198028264916", "personaname": "Zorro_67", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198028264916/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 159, "playtime_forever": 588, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 530, "last_played": 1746473527, "avatar": "61fb61b5eed2b63d7974f77980c19a547c3c99a2"}, "language": "english", "review": "Playing through the most recent games I have mixed feelings about this. It is still 'Elite' with all the sniping, kill-cams, sneaking around, scoping out areas and taking out bad guys. For a sneaky game I still end up in the lethal and assault box on the end of mission debrief, generally because I'm rubbish and end up spraying bullets everywhere.\n\nThe problem is that it's not enough of a step up from previous games. The maps feel a little too small, a little too empty at times - and why can't I hide underneath a vehicle or sneak in the back of one as it drives around? Heck, even the game engine and upgrade systems are still the same from SE5. \n\nIt's serviceable, it's fine as a Sniper game and a good time. But it also needs a bit of a revamp with game-play. As part of the franchise it's not an essential purchase and feels unnecessary. Recommended for first timers (although honestly get 4 or 5 which I think are better) and completionists only.", "timestamp_created": 1744052429, "timestamp_updated": 1744052429, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 29, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.758352160453796387", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "192203919", "author": {"steamid": "76561198116224094", "personaname": "deadmeat", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198116224094/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 1822, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1814, "last_played": 1746015869, "avatar": "0eeca0c580529ca6acca623a7730fb92c775055d"}, "language": "english", "review": "More of the same, but worse. It could have been released as a mega DLC for Sniper 5. No improvement on game play, nothing innovative at all. In fact, they took some things away. Tripwire booby traps are replaced with goofy boxes to render people unconscious, and extra incentives for not wiping every enemy off the board. Do they know there's a war on? Still awkward movement as in previous games, but there were times when you have to jump or get out of the crouching position or something just to get unstuck. A poor follow-up.", "timestamp_created": 1744014612, "timestamp_updated": 1744014612, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 30, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.698471903800964355", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "192163716", "author": {"steamid": "76561198040361782", "personaname": "brent1354", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198040361782/", "num_games_owned": 68, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 3481, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1783, "last_played": 1771106195, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "its enjoyable", "timestamp_created": 1743966119, "timestamp_updated": 1743966119, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "192153269", "author": {"steamid": "76561199063383003", "personaname": "STIGGA", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199063383003/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 9024, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 7127, "last_played": 1765985793, "avatar": "b4754ba74458394d4a310cafcb195f43b1bf8b2f"}, "language": "english", "review": "I would score this game 8 out of 10 , it was not expected so early after SE5 , i think all players were expecting Sniper Elite 6 with a completely new aspect , the introduction of Sabotage missions is none sense , some Maps are that dark when you go indoors you can see nothing, Not many maps are Classics , the DLC Map is probably one of the best, the game for what it is was to expensive and lots of weapons that were standard issue are not there", "timestamp_created": 1743958150, "timestamp_updated": 1743958150, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.514039695262908936", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 18, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "192091738", "author": {"steamid": "76561199414628451", "personaname": "Gape King", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199414628451/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 15, "playtime_forever": 326, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 326, "last_played": 1741555397, "avatar": "14e94214ffd06b4e3684ca043260684da18d8ef2"}, "language": "english", "review": "If you enjoyed the last versions of Sniper Elite, guess what? It is going to be more of the same with a garbage British accent this time", "timestamp_created": 1743897821, "timestamp_updated": 1743897821, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 6, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.485698729753494263", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "192052751", "author": {"steamid": "76561198165944652", "personaname": "ep", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198165944652/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 10091, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 178, "playtime_at_review": 2271, "last_played": 1791030996, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "the right mix between strategy/patience and action for me", "timestamp_created": 1743866099, "timestamp_updated": 1743866099, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "192006831", "author": {"steamid": "76561197965154090", "personaname": "ratlung", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/hubber/", "num_games_owned": 188, "num_reviews": 19, "playtime_forever": 7392, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3757, "last_played": 1784739271, "avatar": "d69e60c2276ee7efcbed9d48252c09d8e88624f8"}, "language": "english", "review": "If you love sniper elite 5, then it's more of the same, and I do love sniper elite 5. The high price considering it's basically the same game with new levels is unwarranted. Also I've recently encountered some quite annoying bugs that have caused me to load from a save point.\n\nThat being said playing in 4k on my OLED HDR the game looks amazing and I really enjoy the game play and sandbox type levels meaning you can pick your avenue of attack which leaves a lot of replay value.\n\nBut also they can stop with the stupidly expensive DLC's. I'd buy them all if they were reasonably priced...", "timestamp_created": 1743818865, "timestamp_updated": 1749553457, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 7, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.589365005493164062", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "192002393", "author": {"steamid": "76561197993839733", "personaname": "Purenrgy", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197993839733/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 29, "playtime_forever": 4604, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4604, "last_played": 1743813395, "avatar": "ff5df2f8cb67ef030825b7add489f2a674432076"}, "language": "english", "review": "I was hoping to do the invasions but the odds are so heavily stacked against you that you just end up spending the whole time getting tacked. They always know where you are coming from so it's not even remotely a challenge for them. Even the odds and make it more realist, then it can be fun.\n\nThe story line is meh, SE 4 was much better. This one is pretty disappointing.", "timestamp_created": 1743813610, "timestamp_updated": 1743813610, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "192000559", "author": {"steamid": "76561197976485742", "personaname": "~*|Reborn|*~", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Boraes/", "num_games_owned": 384, "num_reviews": 35, "playtime_forever": 3228, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3213, "last_played": 1752453412, "avatar": "c63c4ce6e65ad2f6bca461343b7877dccef41e73"}, "language": "english", "review": "So done with this game now. The only reason I got it was because I found the previous games a fun MP casual shooter game. However the complete lack of maps for MP, the maps they do have are awful, they copy and paste maps from previous games and label it a a 'new map' all wrapped up with a premium price.... I can hear their senior execs laughing all the way to the bank for managing to get so many fools to pay such a high price for such little content.", "timestamp_created": 1743811352, "timestamp_updated": 1743811352, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 2, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "191937715", "author": {"steamid": "76561197970602000", "personaname": "Frankus", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197970602000/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 2637, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 272, "last_played": 1756656699, "avatar": "036d96301b136bb0718bdc49911a9281b9f19c61"}, "language": "english", "review": "Brilliant series of games", "timestamp_created": 1743751350, "timestamp_updated": 1743751350, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476190477609634399", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "